# Cordova plugins for Capacitor
capacitor-cordova-ios-plugins

# NOTE: the two entries Capacitor puts here by default are deliberately absent:
#
#   App/App/public
#   App/App/capacitor.config.json
#
# Both are generated by `npx cap sync`, and normally you regenerate them on the
# machine that builds. Here the web bundle is built and synced in the sandbox
# and committed, so opening Xcode and pressing Run is the whole build workflow —
# no terminal, no toolchain to keep alive on the Mac. The cost is a noisier diff
# on every UI change; the trade is deliberate.
